# Event categories

- Event type / category lists must always be **alphabetical (A→Z)** via `localeCompare`.
- Source of truth: `lib/categories.js` (`CATEGORIES` / `listCategories()`).
- When adding or renaming a category, update `lib/categories.js` and keep the array A→Z.
- Do not hardcode an unsorted category order in the UI; load from `/api/categories`.
- Prefer leaving `"All"` as the first filter option in the UI; sort only real categories.
- After category changes, run `npm test` (includes a sort invariant test).

```js
// ❌ BAD — insertion order / ad hoc
["Road", "Gravel", "Alleycat"]

// ✅ GOOD — alphabetical
["Alleycat", "Gravel", "Road"]
```
